# MOD worker release signing key — PLACEHOLDER (intentionally NOT a key block).
#
# internal/selfupdate/key.go go:embeds this file. The release pipeline overwrites
# it with the real ECDSA P-256 public key (the "PUBLIC KEY" PEM block, see
# README.md in this directory) that pairs the private key used by
# `cosign sign-blob --key` when the release binaries are cut.
#
# Deliberately unparseable: with this placeholder compiled in, VerifyArtifact
# refuses EVERY self-update ("no release key compiled in"), so a worker built
# without a key can never be talked into installing an unverified binary.
